			"notes": "## Challenge Craft 1.1.3 — Minecraft 26.3\n\n*Everything new since 1.1.2.*\n\n### New challenge\n\n- 🕳️ **Void Trail** (Level 11) — every block you leave takes its whole column with it, from the build limit down to the void: bedrock, water and lava included. Only End portal frames and the End portal survive, so the run stays winnable. There is no way back — keep moving onto fresh ground.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- **Force Item Battle:** the team screen shows its buttons again (teams, Play Solo, Start Battle, Use Joker) and the lobby lists everyone online, not only players who already joined a team.\n- **Force Item Battle:** the chain is back in the item pool (it is the iron chain in 26.3).\n- **Tutorial:** the highlight ring fits its box at every GUI scale.\n\n### Bob, the Lockout rival *(Early Development Stage)*\n\n- Takes the quick tiles first and only leaps where falling short is harmless.\n- Survives much better on Hard: cover in time, a shield against arrows, nights dug in when they are dangerous, creepers hunted for their powder.\n- Ships with models trained in Bob-against-Bob matches."
